Build output lives outside the tree (see build/mksandbox.sh, MK_BUILD).
The entries below are symlinks or generated files created by
build/mksandbox.sh. The build writes through them, so nothing lands
inside the repository and git diff against the vendor import stays
empty.
/osfmk7.3/osfmk/obj
/osfmk7.3/osfmk/export/at386
/osfmk7.3/osfmk/src/makedefs/sys.mk
/osfmk7.3/osfmk/src/makedefs/osf.man.mk
/osfmk7.3/osfmk/src/makedefs/osf.doc.mk
/osfmk7.3/osfmk/rc_files/osc/Buildconf.local
/obj/
/export/
*.o
*.pp
